      thinking_level: 3
    }
    started_at {
      seconds: 1777899468
      nanos: 399504537
    }
  }
  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have removed the custom admin dashboard to keep your MVP completely streamlined! \n\nHere is exactly how you handle the data and deploy to Vercel\342\200\224with no extra coding required:\n\n### 1. How to View Your Data & Photos (No Google Sheets Needed)\nSince we are using **Supabase**, you actually already have a dashboard that looks and acts *exactly* like Google Sheets! \n\n1. Go to your **Supabase Dashboard** (supabase.com).\n2. Click on **Table Editor** in the left menu, then select the `reports` table. You will see every submitted report in a spreadsheet view (with coordinates, description, category, etc.). You can even export this directly to a CSV/Excel file with \"Export CSV\".\n3. To view the uploaded photos, click on **Storage** in the left menu, then click your `photos` bucket. \n\n*Note: For an MVP, checking the Supabase Table Editor is perfect. If investors ask about automated emails/sheets later, you can simply tell them you plan to link Supabase to Zapier (which takes 5 minutes to set up when you want it).*\n\n### 2. How to Deploy to Vercel\n\nTo host this on Vercel without relying on Google AI Studio:\n\n1. **Export the Code:** In the top right corner of AI Studio, export your project to a **GitHub repository** (or download it as a ZIP and push it to GitHub yourself).\n2. **Go to Vercel:** Log into [Vercel](https://vercel.com) and click **\"Add New...\"** -> **\"Project\"**.\n3. **Import from GitHub:** Select the repository you just created.\n4. **Configure Project:**\n   - **Framework Preset:** Vercel should automatically detect \"**Vite**\". \n   - **Environment Variables:** Open the \"Environment Variables\" section before hitting deploy and add your two exact keys from Supabase:\n     - Name: `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` | Value: *your_supabase_url*\n     - Name: `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Value: *your_supabase_anon_key*\n5. **Click Deploy!** Wait 30 seconds, and Vercel will give you a live, production-ready link (e.g., `hafra-dz.vercel.app`) you can send to your investors."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
