  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Needs**\n\nI\'m focusing on \"as accurate as possible\" geo-location, and hosting the MVP on Vercel. I\'m exploring alternatives to Supabase for data storage, particularly for photos. My initial focus is on pinpointing the user\'s core requirements. I\'m prioritizing accuracy in location tracking, and considering the implications of Vercel deployment.\n\n\n**Evaluating Storage Options**\n\nI\'ve been examining simpler photo storage methods for the MVP. Google Drive via API, ImgBB, and Cloudinary seem promising due to their API simplicity and generous free tiers. Emailing photos using Resend or EmailJS is also an option, though file size limits are a concern. I\'m leaning toward an external webhook to handle data management.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Simplicity for Vercel**\n\nI\'ve refined the photo storage strategy. The best path forward seems to be a combination of ImgBB for image hosting, providing a simple URL, and then utilizing EmailJS for effortless email delivery. Google Sheets via Google Forms or SheetDB remains an alternative. I\'m focusing on ensuring this setup is the easiest to host on Vercel. I\'ve also identified an easy way to enable high accuracy geolocations, via `enableHighAccuracy: true` in the `geolocation` options.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 935067156
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
