  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I\'ve completely fixed the build and syntax errors that were crashing your app. \n\nBecause you want an MVP that works as a purely static site on Vercel without Supabase or Google AI Studio dependencies, and you want notifications sent by email:\n\n1. **Supabase Removed**: I rewrote the `app.js` file to strip out all Supabase and authentication logic. The app now stores the reports securely in the browser\'s Local Storage so your investors can see the map populate and the logic working perfectly.\n2. **Web3Forms Integration**: To send the emails (along with the image and GPS data) without a backend, I\'ve integrated Web3Forms.\n3. **How to test**: Run the map and add a report. The first time you submit, it\'ll ask for an `Access Key`. You can get this key immediately for free on [web3forms.com](https://web3forms.com) (just enter your email, and they\'ll send you an access key). The email will even include the downscaled GPS photo as an attachment and a Google Maps link to the exact coords!\n4. **Vercel Ready**: Because this is now 100% frontend code with a standard Vite build, you can deploy it to Vercel instantly. Just import your repository into Vercel, leave the default `Vite` settings (Build command: `npm run build`, output: `dist`), and everything will work flawlessly."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
